{"title": "It held twice. Then?", "type": "Myth or fact", "hooks": ["Three things beginners believe about support. Two are wrong.", "A level that held before will hold again. Myth or fact?", "Stop trusting support just because it held last time."], "scenes": [{"kind": "hook", "vo": "Three things beginners believe about support. Two are wrong.", "text": "Myth or fact?", "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "The trend doesn't matter", "vo": "Belief one: at a level, the trend doesn't matter. Myth. Before a test, traders check which way the trend runs.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Volume into support is a clue", "vo": "Belief two: rising volume into support makes a break likelier. Fact. Volume drying up is the calmer picture.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Held before, holds again?", "show": 125, "vo": "Belief three: a level that held before will hold again. StoneSage Materials held support near 85 twice, on the hourly chart.", "cues": [{"say": "support near 85", "do": "line", "price": 85.02, "label": "Support", "tone": "teal"}, {"say": "held support", "do": "mark", "i": 115, "label": "1", "side": "low", "tone": "green"}, {"say": "twice", "do": "mark", "i": 120, "label": "2", "side": "low", "tone": "green"}], "win": [55, 150]}, {"kind": "chart", "chart": 0, "head": "Myth. Third test broke.", "vo": "Myth. On the next test it closed through and stayed through. Twenty-five candles later, it was 5.5 percent lower.", "cues": [{"say": "closed through", "do": "reveal", "to": 126}, {"say": "5.5 percent lower", "do": "reveal", "to": 150}, {"say": "Twenty-five candles later", "do": "shade", "from": 125, "to": 150, "tone": "red"}], "win": [55, 150], "show": 125}, {"kind": "big", "text": "Every level needs a stop", "vo": "Levels hold often enough to trade, and break often enough that every trade needs a stop.", "chart": null}, {"kind": "outro", "text": "Test a level yourself", "vo": "Comment myth or fact on the next one, and practise at me